[SPEAKER_04]: Then, moderate in eating, exactly, finding the right reasons for consuming food, mindfulness, watchfulness of your intentions, everything the suttas talk about.

48
00:04:53,085 --> 00:04:59,432
[SPEAKER_06]: And also, probably, just, you know, this recognition of there are situations where the other side

